<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-AWB Australian wheat indicator prices-Oct 15.</title>
<headline>RTRS-AWB Australian wheat indicator prices-Oct 15.</headline>
<dateline>MELBOURNE 1996-10-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>International prices for milling and Durum wheat continued to trade sideways in a very quiet world export market, the Australian Wheat Board (AWB) said. The Australian dollar was firmer overnight, it said.</p>
<p>Wheat indicator prices for multi-grade contracts 96/97 and Durum were unchanged. Prices, FOB, in A$ per tonne:</p>
<p>		    ASW 10 pct		   No 1 DURUM</p>
